      "id": "claim_4bc61ebceb594db5b503091a6cc29558",
      "statement": "Per ADR-PAY-019, Wire Center must not poll PPH for status (only throttled, user-initiated refresh is permitted), so any new wire-lifecycle notification capability must be event-driven, requiring either a PPH v2 migration or a wire-capable Status Projection Service mapping module with a consumer ACL on pay.wire.lifecycle.v2 (SPS today is configured for ACH only).",
