    {
      "id": "claim_b46ad1258f9c42518c2579d4a5b42724",
      "statement": "ENS enforces a Treasury-domain throughput quota of 120 msgs/s within an overall 300 msgs/s sustained / 1,200 msgs/s burst platform capacity, a 4s p95 delivery latency target for push/in-app, last-4 account masking, a ban on Restricted data in payloads/templates, and TCPA-consent-gated 160-character SMS templates.",
